---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Nekurama — where passion meets innovation"
  description="Nekurama brings passion and innovation together through thoughtful engineering, building toward a smarter environment in harmony with nature."
>
  <header class="wrap topbar">
    <a class="wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="Nekurama home" translate="no">NEKURAMA</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#company">Company</a>
      <a href="/products/">Products</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="main" class="wrap">
    <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Passion, given structure</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Where passion meets innovation.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Nekurama is a place to explore ideas and give them structure through thoughtful engineering. We want India to be proud of its engineers and everyone who builds with passion.</p>
        <a class="button" href="/products/">Explore our products <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-art">
        <details class="name-egg">
          <summary aria-label="Reveal the story behind the Nekurama name">
            <img src="/brand/nekurama-line-art-mark.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" fetchpriority="high" />
            <span class="name-egg-hint" aria-hidden="true">Look closer</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="name-egg-story">
            <p class="eyebrow">A name with a few threads</p>
            <h2>Three ideas, one name.</h2>
            <p><strong>Ne Kurama</strong> — my Nine-Tails fox inspiration from Naruto.</p>
            <p><strong>Neku Rama</strong> — a curious cat alongside Lord Rama, from Indian history.</p>
            <p><strong>Nekura + Manoj</strong> — “Watashi wa nekura na seikaku desu” (“I have a gloomy/introverted personality”), joined with my name, Manoj.</p>
            <p class="name-egg-note">These are personal inspirations behind Nekurama, not a formal etymology.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <figcaption><strong>Curiosity opens the way.</strong><span>Thoughtful work gives ideas shape.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="company" aria-labelledby="company-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">A wider horizon</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="company-title">Every venture can be a building block.</h2>
          <p>Our vision extends beyond software—to commodities, real estate, education, and fields still to come. We see each venture as a possible building block toward a smarter environment that grows in harmony with nature.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Explore our products <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="wrap footer-inner"><span translate="no">NEKURAMA</span><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Explore our products</a></div>
  </footer>
</SiteLayout>
